msgid ""
"FrostWire can configure itself to work from behind a firewall or router. "
"Using Universal Plug 'n Play (UPnP) and other NAT traversal techniques "
"FrostWire can automatically configure your router or firewall for optimal "
"performance. If your router does not support UPnP, FrostWire can be set to "
"advertise an external port manually. (You may also have to configure your "
"router if you choose manual configuration, but FrostWire will try its best "
"so you don't have to.)"
